  lines:
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: "Wow, recruit ! You\u2019re really getting the grip of this!\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: 'Continue like that and we may promote you to a better position haha.

'
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: 'In this mission, the enemy decided to use a special ship: The Tank !

      

'
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: 'This unit is REALLY powerful, but they have to wait 3 turns between each
      attack.

      

      

'
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: 'Be reassured, I gave you 2 fortresses to keep up with their power.

      

      

      

'
  - leftSpeaker: 0
    speakerName: Timo
    text: "You can count on me Cadet ! \nRemember, we can only attack or move, but
      not both !\n\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: 'Be sure to show them the power of Groovy tunes, and by that, I mean DESTROY
      THEM !

      

'
